# Civil War Strategy: the keys that move a menu's highlight. At the main menu of March 1861, PgDn
# goes to the last row, Down from there wraps to the first, PgDn and PgUp go to the last and the
# first again. Then Files, Quit to DOS, Yes.
#! seed 1861

# The title menu: Start NEW Game.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# The scenario menu: the Standard Map.
play until 2:S
text s
play until 2:M
digest

# PgDn, Down, PgDn, PgUp: the screen after each.
key pagedown
prompt
digest
key down
prompt
digest
key pagedown
prompt
digest
key pageup
prompt
digest

# Files, Quit to DOS, Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
